Z||000000||william_thorniii||02-08-2000||09:36 AM||||Friends,<P>As some of you know my 87 coupe needs a new belt tensioner.  This process involves draining some coolant and re-routing the belt in addition to replacing the tensioner.  It is in my work parking lot (between WPAFB & downtown).  I can drive it, but I don't think it would make it all the way home.  Can I borrow someones' driveway or garage for part of a day near Dayton?  I will not require any assistance (except maybe when putting the belt on).  I will clean up after myself and will leave the place as I found it.   <P>Many Thanks,<P>William T. Thorn, III  ||||reg||5
