Z||000011||Scott2M4||02-09-2000||10:13 PM||||William:<P>Drew's supposed to be at my place between 6 and 7 for dinner Saturday night.  Why don't you plan to be here between 2 and 3.  We can knock out the belt/tensioner, flush the system and wash up in time for some most-excellent homemade lasagna.  If Drew can be here before 6, you'll have two extra sets of hands to assist.<P>Keep an eye on the weather. I'll send you directions to the house.<BR>||||reg||1
